Description: Fast tools for preparing and analysing large Danish administrative and
    health registry datasets. Provides memory-efficient routines for cohort construction,
    time splitting, code-based condition identification, prescription exposure periods,
    risk-set matching, and direct standardisation. The package is designed for secure
    research environments such as Statistics Denmark and builds on the data structures
    provided by the 'data.table' package.
